NOTICE

This work is a derivative of the "wpad" package for pfSense software by
Marcello Coutinho, distributed as part of Unofficial-pfSense-packages:

    https://github.com/marcelloc/Unofficial-pfSense-packages

The original is Apache-2.0 licensed and its copyright notice is retained above,
as Section 4 of the License requires.

As required by Section 4(b) of the License, the following changes were made to
the original files:

  * wpad_nginx.template: fixed the server block. Two consecutive lines lacked
    their terminating semicolon and the second was not a directive at all, so
    nginx parsed all of it -- including client_max_body_size -- as a single
    server_name with six arguments.

  * Packaging: the package is built and installed as a real pfSense-pkg-WPAD
    rather than by copying files into place, so that it appears in and can be
    removed from System > Package Manager. See docs/PACKAGING.md.
